trorecollections:a"&gt;Video Source Retro Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Juan&amp;rsquo;s games: (&lt;a href="https://www.usebox.net/jjm/"&gt;https://www.usebox.net/jjm/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Buy physical copies of these games:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.polyplay.xyz/navi.php?qs=golden+tail"&gt;Golden Tail&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.polyplay.xyz/navi.php?qs=Kitsune+curse"&gt;Kitsune Curse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mree</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/mree/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2020 13:51:27 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/mree/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Mr. Ee from Micro Power for the BBC Micro nice variation on the Pacman theme.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;iframe id="lbry-iframe" width="560" height="315" src="https://lbry.tv/$/embed/BBC-Mirco-MrEE/8c37287bd9782db6434ff90701d3909bb9843b5c" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.bbcmicro.co.uk/game.php?id=85"&gt;Play Online at BBC Mirco&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>The Pit New Retro Game</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/thepit/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2020 09:08:22 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/thepit/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;New retro game, looks worth getting a Commodore emulator setup to play it.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This style of game is one of my favorites, loved Boulder Dash and Repton.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;iframe id="lbry-iframe" width="560" height="315" src="https://lbry.tv/$/embed/8bit-nibble-the-pit-new-commodore-plus-4/2059e72eb0251e8a354e20834b0c9ee58f0e46e9" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://lbry.tv/@retrorecollections:a"&gt;Video Source Retro Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20260305064809/http://plus4world.powweb.com/software/The_Pit"&gt;The Pit Download&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="h